      <div class="col-media" style="background-image: url('https://via.placeholder.com/900x600?text=Intro+Image');"></div>
      <div class="col-body">
        <h2>About Kissan Help Desk</h2>
        <p>Kissan Help Desk is a practical digital platform built to make modern agricultural guidance simple and local. We convert science-based advice into short, actionable steps farmers can use right now.</p>
        <p class="lead">We cover crop planning, input guidance, weather alerts and local marketplace signals — so farmers can make better, timely decisions.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- SECTION 2: MISSION (slides in from right) -->
